Package: robustsens
Title: Sensitivity and Robustness of Estimators for Pulse Oximeter Signals
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Elsa", "Awoutsa", , "awoutsaelsa@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools to measure how outliers affect estimators of a sensor signal, using the
      empirical sensitivity curve (a Gateaux derivative of the estimator) and simulations.
      Applied to SpO2 measurements from a pulse oximeter.
